8. Commercial Purposes
A commercial purpose is any purpose that involves commercial advantage or monetary compensation.

8.1 Permitted Uses
Noncommercial purposes include:
8.1.1 personal use for personal expenses, hobbies, or leisure activities
8.1.2 education and research
8.1.3 evaluation and testing, but not production use
8.1.4 government and nonprofit organization use, except for production use in commercial activities or in activities that compete with commercial products

8.2 Prohibited Uses
Commercial purposes include:
8.2.1 running the software in production for any business purpose
8.2.2 selling access to the software as a service (SaaS)
8.2.3 selling or licensing products that include the software
8.2.4 using the software to provide commercial services to others

